// Tab through the stops (round again after the last; a box with no room
// passed over), Shift+Tab back, the arrows through a list's items (not
// past its last), and Space or Enter: the box with the focus is the one
// hovered and the pointer let go over it, as a click.
// RUN: sh %S/Inputs/headless.sh %t.dir
// RUN: %ent run -I %t.dir %S/Inputs/layout_keys.ent \
// RUN:     2>/dev/null | FileCheck %s --match-full-lines

// CHECK:      1: at 0 item 0 ring false, hovered 0
// CHECK-NEXT: 2: at 1 item 0 ring true, hovered 0
// CHECK-NEXT: 3: at 2 item 0 ring true, hovered 0
// CHECK-NEXT: 4: at 2 item 1 ring true, hovered 0
// CHECK-NEXT: 5: at 2 item 2 ring true, hovered 0
// CHECK-NEXT: 6: at 2 item 2 ring true, hovered 0
// CHECK-NEXT: 7: at 2 item 1 ring true, hovered 0
// CHECK-NEXT: 8: at 4 item 0 ring true, hovered 0
// CHECK-NEXT: 9: at 1 item 0 ring true, hovered 0
// CHECK-NEXT: 10: at 4 item 0 ring true, hovered 0
// CHECK-NEXT: 11: at 2 item 0 ring true, hovered 0
// CHECK-NEXT: 12: at 2 item 0 ring true, hovered 1 pressed
